{"id": "EUVD-2026-101258", "enisaUuid": "0291c8de-6ab9-351a-9405-66276c128ad3", "description": "VentureDrake Laravel CRM before 2.4.0 contains an incorrect authorization vulnerability in user management that allows authenticated administrators to assign unrestricted roles via Role::find. Attackers with user-management access can assign the Owner role or other teams' roles and delete cross-team users through the unscoped UserIndex delete() method.", "datePublished": "2026-10-14T14:17:04", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-14T20:20:11", "baseScore": 7.0, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:H/UI:N/VC:N/VI:H/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/venturedrake/laravel-crm/issues/79", "https://github.com/venturedrake/laravel-crm/blob/fee88f9f95f18302a49e739298885b455beb02e5/src/Http/Controllers/UserController.php#L87-L94", "https://github.com/venturedrake/laravel-crm/blob/fee88f9f95f18302a49e739298885b455beb02e5/src/Livewire/Users/UserIndex.php#L83-L90", "https://github.com/venturedrake/laravel-crm/commit/d64b59fb9f7355e1be9951fbcc5f54ed715dc212", "https://github.com/venturedrake/laravel-crm/commit/27bd5081004913660ccb3e0181b351a2e4ded104", "https://github.com/venturedrake/laravel-crm/releases/tag/2.4.0", "https://github.com/venturedrake/laravel-crm", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/venturedrake-laravel-crm-before-2.4.0-privilege-escalation-via-unscoped-role-assignment"], "aliases": ["GHSA-x3cj-7rxv-cr85", "CVE-2026-110630"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.64, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "e4f3f998-99cb-3e1f-887c-24a73b20d934", "product": {"name": "laravel-crm", "vendor": {"name": "krayin"}}, "product_version": "0 <2.4.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "3d8e9735-c324-37d5-acbc-ba3451710edf", "vendor": {"name": "venturedrake"}}], "isExploited": false}